{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And the satraps</b>, <b>and the king's ministers</b> — his counselors who are accustomed to him." "<b>On their bodies</b> — their persons, as in: וגשם יגדל." "<b>And the smell of fire</b> — the smell of fire had not passed over them, as in: מעדה בגד ביום קרה." "<b>Was not singed</b> — as in: לא יחרוך רמיה צידו. And he mentions the outer garment and there is no need to mention the others."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:41.206196602Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}